{"id":"vod_sn_36405","vodId":"36405","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"百合熊风暴","name_cn":"百合熊风暴","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0ed47a7a624bc1e86878a924ef50e248.jpg"},"summary":"有一天，小行星熊玛利亚星在宇宙的某处爆发，成就一群坠落地球的流星，使地球各处的熊发生异变。熊大举进食人类，人类再报以还击，结果造成没有战果和充满仇恨的恶性循环，直至两边不约而同筑起断绝之墙，期望以后互不侵犯……一天早上，呼啸山庄学园的学生——椿辉红羽和泉乃纯花，在学园的百合花坛里一同看见百合之花。二人于是成就“既为朋友，亦为恋人”的关系，并将花坛视为最重要的地方。就在此时，熊警报突然响起，揭示对方再度入侵人类世界，准备陷入混战。揭示这些熊的真实身份和目的之时，新谜题的出现带来新一波的怒涛，揭开背后华丽的每一幕……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8NzUK8H9Xc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n3btqEyC4P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xpTrp7sSW51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VzGAZZknAX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HfwL7p4cx21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yt8KDVrfSj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kvhQDBPVXQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wnPqnwhqZr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GyG2PjJdt51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1UZjkbxWpQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xyJ5v9222u1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ge3b2GAc4M1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:23.623Z"}